# Same values already embedded in plaintext in the legacy root index.html/admin.html
# (anon/public key — safe client-side, protected by Row Level Security on the DB
# side). Committed (unlike .env.local) so `vite build` in CI has them: the GitHub
# Actions workflow has no other way to inject env vars into the production build,
# and the blank-screen bug this file fixes was exactly that — the build shipped
# with these undefined, so supabaseClient.ts threw at module load in every visitor's
# browser before React could render anything.
